<div class="q-wrap">
<div class="q-head"><div><h1>🧮 Calculadora Comercial</h1><p>Importe tabelas, aplique custos e margens, monte o orçamento e envie pelo WhatsApp.</p></div><div class="q-actions"><a class="q-btn" href="/ferramentas">← Ferramentas</a><button class="q-btn" id="newQuote">＋ Novo</button><button class="q-btn" id="openSettings">⚙️ Configurações</button><button class="q-btn primary" id="saveQuote">💾 Salvar</button></div></div>
<% if(flash){ %><div class="q-flash"><%= flash %></div><% } %><% if(error){ %><div class="q-flash q-error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
<div class="q-layout"><div class="q-stack">
<div class="q-card"><div class="q-tabs"><button class="q-tab active" data-tab="prepare">1. Tabela de preços</button><button class="q-tab" data-tab="quote">2. Orçamento manual</button></div>
<div class="q-panel active" id="panel-prepare">
<details class="q-supplier-details" style="margin-bottom:10px"><summary>📚 Tabelas de fornecedores salvas <span id="savedTablesCount"></span></summary><div class="q-supplier-details-body"><p class="q-sub">Abra somente quando precisar carregar ou excluir uma tabela já salva.</p><div class="q-saved-tables" id="savedTables"></div></div></details>
<div class="q-import-top">
<div class="q-drop"><h2>📊 Importar Excel</h2><p class="q-sub">Aceita .xls, .xlsx, .xlsm e .csv. O painel tenta identificar produto, preço e cabeçalho automaticamente.</p><input class="q-input" id="excelFile" type="file" accept=".xls,.xlsx,.xlsm,.csv"><button class="q-btn primary" id="uploadExcel" style="margin-top:8px">Importar planilha</button><div class="q-auto-note" id="autoImportStatus" style="display:none"></div><button class="q-btn q-manual-toggle" id="toggleManualColumns" style="display:none">⚙️ Selecionar colunas manualmente</button></div>
<div class="q-drop"><h2>💬 Colar lista do WhatsApp</h2><p class="q-sub">Cole a lista e o painel tenta separar o último valor de cada linha.</p><textarea class="q-textarea" id="whatsList" placeholder="iPhone 16 128GB 850\nRedmi Note 14 Pro - 310"></textarea><div class="q-inline" style="margin-top:8px"><button class="q-btn" id="parseWhats">Ler lista colada</button><button class="q-btn" id="clearWhatsList" type="button" title="Limpar lista colada" aria-label="Limpar lista colada">🧹</button></div></div>
</div>
<div class="q-map" id="excelMap"><div class="q-grid"><div class="q-field s3"><label>Aba</label><select class="q-select" id="sheetSelect"></select></div><div class="q-field s3"><label>Coluna do produto</label><select class="q-select" id="nameColumn"></select></div><div class="q-field s3"><label>Coluna do preço</label><select class="q-select" id="priceColumn"></select></div><div class="q-field s3"><label>Começar na linha</label><input class="q-input" id="startRow" type="number" min="1" value="1"></div></div><div class="q-inline" style="margin-top:8px"><button class="q-btn primary" id="confirmColumns">Usar estas colunas</button><span id="excelName" class="q-sub" style="margin:9px 0 0"></span></div><div class="q-preview" id="matrixPreview" style="margin-top:8px"></div></div>
<div id="preparedArea" style="display:none"><div class="q-workspace-bar"><div class="q-field"><label>Fornecedor</label><input class="q-input" id="supplierName" placeholder="Ex.: Distribuidora ABC"></div><div class="q-field"><label>Nome da tabela</label><input class="q-input" id="tableName" placeholder="Ex.: Ofertas de Julho Xiaomi"></div><div class="q-field"><label>Origem</label><input class="q-input" id="sourceFile" readonly></div><div class="q-field"><label>Salvar</label><button class="q-btn dark" id="saveSupplierTable">💾 Salvar tabela</button></div></div><div class="q-prep-tools" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr)"><div class="q-field"><label>Moeda da tabela</label><select class="q-select prep-change" id="sourceCurrency"><option value="USD">Dólar (US$)</option><option value="BRL">Real (R$)</option></select></div><div class="q-field"><label>PTAX BCB</label><input class="q-input prep-change" id="dollarBase" type="number" min="0" step="0.0001"></div><div class="q-field"><label>Acréscimo manual</label><input class="q-input prep-change" id="dollarAdd" type="number" min="0" step="0.0001"></div><div class="q-field"><label>Dólar utilizado</label><input class="q-input" id="dollarRate" type="number" readonly></div><div class="q-field"><label>Importação padrão (%)</label><input class="q-input prep-change" id="bulkImport" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"></div><div class="q-field"><label>Lucro padrão (R$)</label><input class="q-input" id="bulkProfit" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"></div><div class="q-field"><label>Cotação</label><button class="q-btn" id="updateDollar">↻ Atualizar BCB</button><small id="dollarInfo"></small></div></div><div class="q-inline" style="margin-bottom:8px"><button class="q-btn" id="applyImport">Aplicar taxa</button><button class="q-btn success" id="fillMargins">Preencher margens</button></div>
<div class="q-term-bar"><div><strong>Condições exibidas na tabela</strong><small>A ordem em que você selecionar as parcelas será a mesma usada na mensagem.</small></div><div class="q-inline" style="align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end"><select class="q-select" id="tablePaymentChannel" style="width:auto"><option value="card">Cartão</option><option value="credit">Crediário / boleto</option></select><select class="q-select" id="tableCashMode" style="width:auto"><option value="withFee">À vista com taxa</option><option value="noFee">À vista sem taxa</option></select><button type="button" class="q-term-chip active" id="tableCashToggle">À vista</button><div class="q-term-chips" id="termChips"></div></div></div>
<div class="q-filterbar"><input class="q-input" id="productSearch" placeholder="Pesquisar na tabela..."><button class="q-btn success" id="filterNames">🧹 Filtrar nomes</button><button class="q-btn" id="compareTable">↕ Comparar com anterior</button></div>
<div class="q-bulk-actions">
  <div class="q-field"><label>Adicionar condição aos nomes</label><select class="q-select" id="bulkCondition"><option value="Novo lacrado">Novo lacrado</option><option value="Usado">Usado</option><option value="Vitrine">Vitrine</option><option value="Seminovo">Seminovo</option><option value="Importado">Importado</option><option value="custom">Personalizado...</option></select></div>
  <div class="q-field"><label>Texto personalizado</label><input class="q-input" id="bulkConditionCustom" placeholder="Ex.: Seminovo" disabled></div>
  <button class="q-btn" id="applyCondition" type="button">Aplicar nos selecionados</button>
  <div class="q-field"><label>Lucro manual em massa (R$)</label><input class="q-input" id="manualBulkProfit" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="Ex.: 350"></div>
  <div class="q-field"><label>Modo</label><select class="q-select" id="manualProfitMode"><option value="replace">Substituir lucro</option><option value="add">Somar ao lucro</option></select></div>
